# Which files belong to whom. Patterns use fnmatch (`*` also matches `/`).
#
# owned    — belongs to the framework: copied by `fw install`, overwritten by `fw update`.
#            Never customise these in a project; change the upstream template instead.
# scaffold — starting point for the project: copied by `fw install` only when missing,
#            never touched by `fw update`. The project owns them after that.

owned framework/*
owned .claude/skills/fw-*
owned docs/framework/*

scaffold CLAUDE.md
scaffold .claude/settings.json
scaffold .claude/agents/.gitkeep
scaffold .fw/config.json
scaffold .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*
scaffold .github/pull_request_template.md
scaffold docs/*
scaffold mkdocs.yml
